MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 WhileTest_TestWhile
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

WhileTest_TestWhile [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 0

MOVE TEMP 2 0
L2	CJUMP LE TEMP 1 4 L4
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 4 L3

L3	
MOVE TEMP 2 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 1


PRINT TEMP 2


MOVE TEMP 1 PLUS TEMP 1 1


JUMP L2
L4	NOOP

RETURN 0
END

